64"}, {"file_name": "ChatGPT Image Jun 3, 2026, 12_09_25 PM (5).png", "id": "1676798993518766", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823790_1676799000185432_506523996309936772_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b904q_ko_CgQ7kNvwGssbW6&_nc_oc=Adpb_BNmpZJF6k1W4ENm4CXSMT1PKypro0LdPdbQ6hGIhl0xq6hXufW-QIcG2igu5Mk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9muaCs8B9HRsBWAPgOk-3riYpZAO5ip096ynODjbhFVA&oe=6A37FDD2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Kine", "keywords": ["Kodi", "HDR", "Dolby", "MVC", "BD3D"], "long_description": "A free Quest-optimized Kodi fork with a built-in VR player for MVC 3D Blu-ray ISOs and other 3D movies, plus seamless HDR10, Dolby Vision and Dolby Atmos playback for local and network media libraries.\n\nWith its **beautiful interfaces and powerful skinning engine**, Kine is the ideal solution for your Quest \"home theater\".\n\n# Give your media the love it deserves\n\nKine can be used to play almost all popular audio and video formats around. It was designed for network playback, so you can stream your multimedia from anywhere in the house or directly from the internet using practically any protocol available.\n\nPoint Kine to your media and watch it **scan and automagically create a personalized library** complete with box covers, descriptions, and fanart. There are playlist and slideshow functions, a weather forecast feature and many audio visualizations. Once installed, your Quest will become a fully functional multimedia jukebox.\n", "short_description": "A free Quest-optimized Kodi fork with a built-in VR player for MVC 3D Blu-ray ISOs and other 3D movies, plus seamless HDR10, Dolby Vision and Dolby Atmos playback for local and network media libraries."}]}, "developer_name": "Team Kine", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/vkapartzianis/xbmc/blob/Omega/PRIVACY.md", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": 